<title>ISRAEL: At least four dead in two Jerusalem blasts.</title>
<headline>At least four dead in two Jerusalem blasts.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least four people were killed in two explosions at an outdoor market in the heart of Jerusalem on Wednesday, Israel Radio said.</p>
